  characterName: Captain Light
  characterAvatar: {fileID: 4723107735738678597, guid: 6ca7701dd33647344a233657ae4c8424, type: 3}
  combinedLines: "\"Far worse than dangerous. Remember this: if you hear disembodied
    whispers echoing through the mist, run as fast as you can, and DO NOT look back.\"
    | \"It means the Umbral Fiends have caught our scent. Their shadow strikes will
    wither your soul before you even realize you've been hit.\" | \"Let\u2019s move.
    We have people to save.\""
